        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Webb%2C_Mississippi"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The first post office opened in 1880 and was called Hood, honoring one of the area's early settlers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Webb%2C_Mississippi"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Later, the town was renamed Webb to honor Judge Webb, a prominent local figure.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Webb%2C_Mississippi"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Webb officially incorporated in 1905, establishing its municipal government and formal town status.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Webb%2C_Mississippi"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In the early days, groceries were ferried down the river by flat‑bottom boats from Sharkey to Hood.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
